<body>
    <h1>F167030 =E2=80=93 RX - Release Payment Holds</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong>F167030 =E2=80=93 RX Release Payment Holds</strong></p>
<p>This document is the complete, production-ready architecture for enablin=
g <strong>member self-service release of PBM mail-order =E2=80=9CPayment Ho=
ld=E2=80=9D</strong> in the Aetna portal using <strong>only PBM Experience =
API (REST) calls</strong>. It includes: scope &amp; actors, end-to-end beha=
vior, API contracts, PUML flows (sequence + optional activity), data models=
, error handling, NFRs, acceptance tests, and an ops runbook.</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>1) Scope &amp; Goals (PBM-Only, REST-Only)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Goal:</strong> Allow a member to clear a <strong>PBM mail-order =
RX</strong> payment hold when eligible.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>How:</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Detect eligibility</strong> via <strong>Experience API</strong> =
(REST) =E2=80=94 shows =E2=80=9CChange Payment Method=E2=80=9D CTA when rea=
son=3D54.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Submit payment + consent</strong> via <strong>Experience API</st=
rong> (REST).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Resolve the payment hold</strong> via <strong>Experience API</st=
rong> (REST).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Refresh</strong> the order, <strong>purge cache</strong>, and <s=
trong>audit</strong>.</p></li>
</ol>
<p>Constraint: <strong>No new PBM endpoints</strong>. Use only existing <st=
rong>Experience API</strong> routes.</p>
<p><strong>2) Actors &amp; Components</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Member (Portal Web/Mobile)</strong> =E2=80=94 the end user.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Aetna Portal</strong> =E2=80=94 UI; calls Experience API; manage=
s cache &amp; audit locally.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>PBM Experience API (REST)</strong> =E2=80=94 CVS Caremark APIs.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Aetna Transient Cache</strong> =E2=80=94 short-TTL RX/order cach=
e (to be purged after action).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Aetna Audit Store</strong> =E2=80=94 append-only log of member a=
ctions and results.</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>3) End-to-End Behavior (Narrative)</strong></p>
<p><strong>Step 1 =E2=80=94 Detect eligibility (read)</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Member opens RX details.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Portal calls GET /experience/high-cost-hold?rxId=3D{rxId}&amp;memberId=
=3D{memberId}.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If response indicates status=3D"ELIGIBLE", selfServeOption=3D"PAYMENT_HO=
LD", and filters.fillStatusReasonCode=3D54, the UI renders <strong>=E2=80=
=9CChange Payment Method=E2=80=9D</strong> CTA with short guidance.</p></li=
>
</ol>
<p><strong>Response excerpt</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "status": "ELIGIBLE",
    "selfServeOption": "PAYMENT_HOLD",
    "filters": {
        "fillStatusReasonCode": 54
    },
    "displayValue": "Change Payment Method"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Step 2 =E2=80=94 Submit payment &amp; consent (action)</strong><=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Member confirms/enters a payment instrument and provides <strong>consent=
</strong> (Y/N).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Portal calls:</p></li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>POST /experience/payment-consent</p>
<p>Headers: Idempotency-Key: &lt;uuid&gt;, X-Trace-Id: &lt;traceId&gt;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Body:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "orderId": "ORD-10001",
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567",
            "consentResponse": "Y"
        }
    ],
    "paymentInstrument": {
        "token": "pm_..."
    },
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "traceId": "&lt;traceId&gt;"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>API returns { "status": "accepted", "consentReference": "CONS-9f2c3" }.<=
/p>
<p><strong>Step 3 =E2=80=94 Resolve the payment hold (authoritative action)=
</strong></p>
<p>Portal calls:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>POST /experience/orders/{orderId}/resolve-payment-hold</p>
<p>Headers: Idempotency-Key: &lt;uuid&gt;, X-Trace-Id: &lt;traceId&gt;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Body:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567"
        }
    ],
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "consentReference": "CONS-9f2c3",
    "traceId": "&lt;traceId&gt;"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>API responds with { "result": "released", "auditId": "AUD-20251010-001" =
}.</p>
<p>If your Experience API models submit-consent <strong>and</strong> releas=
e as a <strong>single</strong> operation, collapse Steps 2 &amp; 3 into:</p=
>
<blockquote>
<p>POST /experience/orders/{orderId}/payment-hold:resolve</p>
<p>Headers: Idempotency-Key: &lt;uuid&gt;, X-Trace-Id: &lt;traceId&gt;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Body: { orderId, rx[], paymentInstrument, consentResponse, memberId, tra=
ceId }</p>
<p><strong>Step 4 =E2=80=94 Hygiene &amp; confirmation</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Portal <strong>purges the transient RX/order cache</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Portal writes an <strong>audit</strong> entry with actor, IDs, traceId, =
and the provider-returned auditId.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Portal calls GET /experience/orders/{orderId} and confirms the hold is g=
one.</p></li>
<li>
<p>UI shows success: <strong>=E2=80=9CPayment hold released. Your order wil=
l continue processing.=E2=80=9D</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>On any error, UI shows provider message and enables retry.</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p><strong>4) Flows</strong></p>
<p><strong>4.1 Sequence (REST-only via Experience API)</strong></p><span cl=
ass=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embed=
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" width=
=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"99e5d4123c10c0609119dbe9591710b8ec80a40999=
bc1ebf165ba7581f40d128" data-image-src=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/4878008477/att_2_for_4878008477.png?version=3D1&a=
mp;modificationDate=3D1760102538041&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data=
-height=3D"451" data-width=3D"624" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data=
-linked-resource-id=3D"4877943145" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-=
linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"a=
tt_2_for_4878008477.png" data-base-url=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/=
wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-=
container-id=3D"4878008477" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" da=
ta-media-id=3D"31a051c3-028d-4818-bd9f-27350d85b597" data-media-type=3D"fil=
e" height=3D"338"></span>
<p><strong>4.2 Activity</strong></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file=
-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"=
confluence-embedded-image image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D=
"0da2a1bdb2d33e4386651cb2559ccfca1d39b6b0b2ac177423c63ffaa477bfe9" data-ima=
ge-src=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/487800=
8477/att_1_for_4878008477.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1760102538=
029&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"480" data-width=3D"62=
4" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"487804123=
4" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachme=
nt" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"att_1_for_4878008477.png" data-ba=
se-url=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-conte=
nt-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4878008477" data=
-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D"48aa611f-16e2-459=
0-9469-0eb09d06fcb9" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"360"></span>
<p><strong>5) API Contracts (Experience API =E2=80=94 REST)</strong></p>
<p>Replace placeholders with the exact provider paths/fields from PBM team =
exposes.</p>
<p><strong>5.1 Eligibility (read)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>GET</strong> /experience/high-cost-hold?rxId=3D{rxId}&amp;member=
Id=3D{memberId}</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>200</strong>:</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "status": "ELIGIBLE",
    "selfServeOption": "PAYMENT_HOLD",
    "filters": {
        "fillStatusReasonCode": 54
    },
    "displayValue": "Change Payment Method"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>5.2 Submit payment + consent (action)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>POST</strong> /experience/payment-consent</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Headers</strong>: Idempotency-Key, X-Trace-Id</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Body</strong>:</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "orderId": "ORD-10001",
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567",
            "consentResponse": "Y"
        }
    ],
    "paymentInstrument": {
        "token": "pm_..."
    },
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "traceId": "..."
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>202/200</strong>:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "status": "accepted",
    "consentReference": "CONS-9f2c3"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>5.3 Resolve payment hold (action)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>POST</strong> /experience/orders/{orderId}/resolve-payment-hold<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Headers</strong>: Idempotency-Key, X-Trace-Id</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Body</strong>:</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567"
        }
    ],
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "consentReference": "CONS-9f2c3",
    "traceId": "..."
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>200</strong>:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "result": "released",
    "auditId": "AUD-20251010-001"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>5.4 Refresh order (read)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>GET</strong> /experience/orders/{orderId}</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>200</strong> (excerpt):</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "order": {
        "status": "OK",
        "holds": []
    }
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p><strong>6) Data Shapes (Portal-side)</strong></p>
<p><strong>PaymentConsentSubmission</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "orderId": "ORD-10001",
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567",
            "consentResponse": "Y"
        }
    ],
    "paymentInstrument": {
        "token": "pm_..."
    },
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "traceId": "TRACE-..."
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>HoldResolutionRequest</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "rx": [
        {
            "rxNumber": "1234567"
        }
    ],
    "memberId": "M-12345",
    "consentReference": "CONS-9f2c3",
    "traceId": "TRACE-..."
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>AuditEvent (Aetna-owned)</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "auditId": "AUD-20251010-001",
    "actor": {
        "type": "MEMBER",
        "id": "M-12345"
    },
    "domain": "PBM",
    "orderId": "ORD-10001",
    "rx": [
        "1234567"
    ],
    "action": "HOLD_RELEASED",
    "traceId": "TRACE-...",
    "timestamp": "2025-10-10T14:31:22Z"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p><strong>7) Error Handling &amp; Edge Cases</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Eligibility false/changed</strong>: Don=E2=80=99t show CTA; re-c=
heck on page refresh or after order changes.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Consent rejected</strong>: Show provider message; allow retry. L=
og an audit entry with status.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Resolve failed</strong>: Persist failure audit; present readable=
 message &amp; retry.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Idempotency</strong>: Replays with same Idempotency-Key must not=
 double-apply actions.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Multiple RX</strong>: Support array of rxNumber; only release th=
e RX the member authorized.</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p><strong>8) Non-Functional Requirements</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Transport</strong>: REST only (Experience API).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Availability</strong>: Portal remains usable (read-only) when ac=
tions are unavailable.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Latency targets</strong>: p95 GET =E2=89=A4 300 ms; p95 POST =E2=
=89=A4 600 ms.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Security</strong>: payment instruments are tokenized; minimum id=
entifiers in payloads.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Observability</strong>: X-Trace-Id propagated; dashboards for su=
ccess/error rates, retry counts, and time-to-release.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Compliance</strong>: Append-only audit for every attempt (succes=
s or failure).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rate limiting</strong>: Client-side throttles to avoid accidenta=
l hammering on repeated retries.</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p><strong>9) Acceptance Criteria</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Eligibility rendering</strong>: RX with reason 54 consistently r=
eturns ELIGIBLE/PAYMENT_HOLD; CTA visible.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Consent submission</strong>: POST /experience/payment-consent ac=
cepts tokenized payment; returns a consentReference.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Release</strong>: POST /experience/orders/{orderId}/resolve-paym=
ent-hold returns {result:"released", auditId}; subsequent refresh shows no =
hold.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Idempotency</strong>: Duplicate POSTs with the same key return t=
he original result without duplicate side effects.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit &amp; Telemetry</strong>: Every attempt (success/failure) =
is recorded with actor, IDs, traceId, and provider status.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>UX</strong>: Errors show provider messages; retry is available; =
success toast shown and detail reflects updated state.</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p><strong>10) Ops Runbook</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Provider outage (Experience API)</strong>: surface friendly erro=
r; enable retry; log failure audit; monitor backlog &amp; success recovery =
after restoration.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Portal instability</strong>: fall back to read-only; suppress ac=
tions where possible; keep eligibility checks but avoid POSTs until stable.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Hotfix knobs</strong>: feature flag to hide the CTA globally; ad=
justable retry backoff; configurable idempotency key TTL.</p></li>
</ul>
